                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great implementation of the board game, just be sure to custom set the player timer, it is for each player, for their entire decision time taken during the game (something like 45 minutes minimum to 45 days maximum). Player who exhausts their time is automatically forfeit. Games store if dropped, you can come back to them, which is lovely if some players need to leave mid game. Multiplayer server dropped the first time we tried to play though and did not come back at all for a couple of days. No problem seen since to be fair, but it was frustrating on the night after our group all bought it.",
